"cloud-init user. In the code below it se establece en pjonesci. You will "
"también see in the Task below we are using environment variables to pull "
"in the dirección IP of la base de datos host (MYSQL_HOST variable). We "
"are able para hacer esto because in the App Blueprint we will connect the"
" tiers which means Instances in a tier can import the evars desde "
"Instances in connected tiers."

